    "By default, Anim Recovery launches Maya Standalone sessions to save extra information to allow the user to roll back the animation in time.": "Por padr\u00e3o, o Anim Recovery inicia sess\u00f5es aut\u00f4nomas do Maya para salvar informa\u00e7\u00f5es extras e permitir ao usu\u00e1rio reverter a anima\u00e7\u00e3o no tempo.", 
