    "Stores your selected pose as the preferred default pose (also known as T-pose, neutral, zero or bind pose).": "Armazena sua pose selecionada como a pose padr\u00e3o preferida (tamb\u00e9m conhecida como T-pose, neutral, zero ou bind pose).", 
