    "TIP: Use World Space sliders if you want them to consider the global transform by combining animation curves in Animation Layers.": "DICA: use os sliders de Word Space se quiser que eles considerem a transforma\u00e7\u00e3o global combinando curvas de anima\u00e7\u00e3o nas Camadas de anima\u00e7\u00e3o", 
