    "That\u2019s a way to visually organize your keys. Green keys are good for identifying baked keys (frame-by-frame).": "Essa \u00e9 uma maneira de organizar visualmente suas chaves. Chaves  verdes s\u00e3o boas para identificar as chaves de cozimento (frame-a-frame).", 
